# Finding 654: remove automatic credentialed execution of same-repository PR
# code. Preview deployment is manual-only, validates write authority, rejects
# forks and moved heads, and checks out the API-resolved immutable merge SHA.
# The token remains scoped to the preview environment/account and expires in
# 30 days. Static contract tests keep this trust boundary fail-closed.
.github/workflows/preview.yml
.github/workflows/ci.yml
scripts/mint-preview-token.mjs
scripts/preview-workflow-trust.mjs
docs/architecture/004-ci-cd.md
package.json
scopes/security-preview-manual-gate.scope
